{"Removing the cache mutex in BuildIndex allows concurrent builds for the same index key, leading to redundant indexing, Bleve index memory leaks (as the overwritten index is not closed), and potential ErrorIndexPathExists errors when multiple goroutines concurrently attempt to create the same file-based index directory": 0.8140304088592529, "bleveBackend.TotalDocs iterates b.cache without locking while BuildIndex writes to b.cache under cacheMu, causing concurrent map iteration and map write panics after the PR removed the coarse cacheMu lock around BuildIndex": 0.618180513381958, "searchSupport.init increments totalBatchesIndexed and assigns to the outer err variable from multiple goroutines without synchronization, causing data races and potentially incorrect span events/error propagation during startup indexing": 0.0680495873093605, "The integration test unconditionally skips for postgres, reducing CI coverage and making regressions in that configuration more likely to ship unnoticed": 0.6662001609802246}